 flee?","answer":"Timothy is to flee youthful lusts.","sourceFields":{"Tags":"","Quote":"","Occurrence":"0"},"scriptureTargets":[{"book":"2TI","chapter":2,"verse":22,"endVerse":null,"scope":"2TI.2.22","startOnlyForReaderLink":true}],"attributionId":"utq-v91","reviewStatus":"SOURCE_RECORD_UNALTERED_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_FACT_CHECKED"},{"id":"utq:v91:2TI:2:24:qfn0","source":{"publisher":"unfoldingWord","resource":"en_tq","version":"91","bookFile":"en_tq/tq_2TI.tsv","sourceLine":30,"originalId":"qfn0","originalReference":"2:24"},"book":"2TI","reference":"2:24","question":"What does Paul say that a servant of the Lord must be?","answer":"A servant of the Lord must be patient, kind to all, and able to teach.","sourceFields":{"Tags":"","Quote":"","Occurrence":"0"},"scriptureTargets":[{"book":"2TI","chapter":2,"verse":24,"endVerse":null,"scope":"2TI.2.24","startOnlyForReaderLink":true}],"attributionId":"utq-v91","reviewStatus":"SOURCE_RECORD_UNALTERED_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_FACT_CHECKED"},{"id":"utq:v91:2TI:2:25:cinr","source":{"publisher":"unfoldingWord","resource":"en_tq","version":"91","bookFile":"en_tq/tq_2TI.tsv","sourceLine":31,"originalId":"cinr","originalReference":"2:25"},"book":"2TI","reference":"2:25","question":"How must a servant of the Lord treat those who oppose him?","answer":"A servant of the Lord must educate in meekness those who oppose him.","sourceFields":{"Tags":"","Quote":"","Occurrence":"0"},"scriptureTargets":[{"book":"2TI","chapter":2,"verse":25,"endVerse":null,"scope":"2TI.2.25","startOnlyForReaderLink":true}],"attributionId":"utq-v91","reviewStatus":"SOURCE_RECORD_UNALTERED_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_FACT_CHECKED"},{"id":"utq:v91:2TI:2:26:wwj0","source":{"publisher":"unfoldingWord","resource":"en_tq","version":"91","bookFile":"en_tq/tq_2TI.tsv","sourceLine":32,"originalId":"wwj0","originalReference":"2:26"},"book":"2TI","reference":"2:26","question":"What has the devil done with unbelievers?","answer":"The devil has trapped and captured the unbelievers for his wi